=2 Walkthrough
* Speak to {n:Arminibit} and {n:Ceraulian} in {z:Port San d'Oria} (I-9) inside Cargo Room A.
** {z:Auction House} or {p:Mog House} {p:Home Point} are both close.
* Speak to {n:Novalmauge} who walks between (F-8) and (G-8) in {z:Bostaunieux Oubliette} Map 1 (enter from {z:Northern San d'Oria} (I/J-6) HP#2 and then {z:Chateau d'Oraguille} (I/J-8) ) for a cutscene.
** Access to {z:Chateau d'Oraguille} is required to talk to Novalmauge in the {z:Bostaunieux Oubliette}. You must be at least {M:Rank 2 in San d'Oria|San d'Oria Mission 1-3|Save the Children}, or have started {M:Mission 2-3 as a Bastok|Bastok Mission 2-3|The Emissary}/{M:Windurst|Windurst Mission 2-3|The Three Kingdoms} citizen in order to enter {z:Chateau d'Oraguille}.
** Note: If you have not yet completed the quest {q:The Rumor|The Rumor|The Rumor} ({@i:Drain (Scroll)|4853} {p:Drain|Drain (Scroll)} Quest), you can speak to {n:Novalmauge} a second time to accept {q:The Rumor|The Rumor|The Rumor}. You no longer need to complete {q:The Rumor|The Rumor|The Rumor} before advancing the job quest.
* Speak to {n:Morjean} in {z:Northern San d'Oria} (L-7), within the Cathedral's Manuscript room for a cutscene.
** The quest will show up on quests tab now.
* If you don't already happen to have some, buy a {@i:Pickaxe|605} {i:Pickaxe|Pickaxe|605}.
** {n:Ostalie} in {z:Southern San d'Oria} (F-8) around Home Point #4 is nearby.
** {@i:Trbl. Pickaxe|6002}** {i:Trailblazing Pickaxe|Trbl. Pickaxe|6002} does not work**. It must be a regular Pickaxe.
* Go to the {z:Maze of Shakhrami} and **trade** (/trade) a {@i:Pickaxe|605} {i:Pickaxe|Pickaxe|605} to an **Excavation Point** to receive a {@i:Wyvern Egg|1159} {i:Wyvern Egg|Wyvern Egg|1159}.
** If you come across "Fossil Rock," they are unrelated to this quest.
** See the map on the right for Excavation Points (blue dots).
* Return to {n:Morjean} and speak to him with the {@i:Wyvern Egg|1159} {i:Wyvern Egg|Wyvern Egg|1159} in your inventory.
* Travel to {z:Meriphataud Mountains} (K-8) and look for a **???** near the base of {p:Drogaroga's Spine}. Trade the {@i:Wyvern Egg|1159} {i:Wyvern Egg|Wyvern Egg|1159} to it for a cutscene.
** Quickest way is the {p:Survival Guide} to {z:Castle Oztroja} via {p:Aragoneu} . Step outside and you're looking at the spine's base.
* Speak to {p:Rahal} in {z:Chateau d'Oraguille} (H-9).
** He will provide you the {@k} {k:Dragon curse remedy}.
* Travel to {z:Ghelsba Outpost} to find the Hut Door at (F-10/G-10) to enter a BC fight. Quickest way to BC Entrance is {n:Domenic} Teleport NPC in {z:Lower Jeuno}.
** The enemy in this BC is {p:Wyvern|Category:Wyvern} {p:Notorious Monster|Category:Notorious Monsters} that is approximately level 40.
** Only people up to this point in the quest or players who have already completed the quest may enter this BC.
** You are unable to summon trusts in this fight.
* Upon defeating the Wyvern, you will receive your reward.
* There are more {p:wyvern names|Wyvern (Dragoon Pet)} to choose from if you pay to rename it.

